    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jotel i kitipa pa jom'oyeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me wac m'otire: Ka nyatoro wanya bedo jatel ma kitipa pa jom'oyeyo, go wanya tic maber swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TIT.1.6+TIT.1.7+TIT.1.8+TIT.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tito 1:6-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jatel ripo bedo dhano m'ongoye gi komo; go ripo bedo jadhako acel, m'oŋeyo kuro nge, ma niaŋ maber, ma timo gi dwoŋ, m'oŋeyo jolo ji peco pere; go ripo bedo ni nyalo fonjo maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiripi bedo jamero kosa jagero, to wobedi ŋata mwol ma ki jadhaw; aka wokiri womar pesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ripo bedo ŋata nyalo tic ma peco pere maber, to fonjo nyithindho pere mwolo gi miyo ji dwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato ka dhano kinyal tic ma peco pere won, onyali nedi kuro kitipa pa jom'oyeyo pa Were? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go wokiri wobedi dhano ma nyaka owire manyen i yeyo, ameno go nyalo kwoto gi pakirok t'ithumo rigo banja, paka othum ri Jwogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ripo bedo dhano ma ji ma woko jomiyo dwoŋ, aka nyaka k'ocay go to podho i bwo pa Jwogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jokony i kitipa pa jom'oyeyo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokony ma kitipa pa jom'oyeyo bende joripo bedo joma kiti jo otire, ma ki jotwodo, jokiri jowobedi jomero kosa joma wor i lim; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "joripo cwire kwoŋ nyaliŋliŋ ma yeyo kodi paro m'otire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iripo temo jo kutho, aka ka jotire, nyaka jonyalo tic paka jokony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon pajo bende joripo bedo ji ma kiti gin otire, ma jokiwerawera gi luwo kicar; joripo bedo jom'oŋeyo kuro nge kendo joma genere i gimoro je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jakony ma kitipa pa jom'oyeyo ripo bedo jadhako acel kende, aka jo kodi cege joripo kuro nyithindho kodi peco pajo maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole joma timo tic maber jolimo kacungo maber aka jonyalo luwo gi miseni kwoŋ yeyo manitie i Kristo Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyaliŋliŋ madwoŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka andiko balwa me rin, ageno bino nenin mayot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'agalo, balwa me bino miyin iŋey kite ma waripo bedo gine i peco pa Were, m'obedo kitipa pa jom'oyeyo pa Were makwo, siro kendo cakirok p'adier. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'ongoye kiganagana, nyaliŋliŋ ma yeyo mawan dwoŋ:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
